m/users/freshp86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-04-20T05:31:54Z","updated_at":"2017-04-20T05:31:54Z","body":"Thanks for triaging quickly. Just adding a few more cases that exhibit the same problem\r\n\r\n**Before**\r\n```js\r\nlet a = { \r\n  /* comment */ foo: 'hello'\r\n};\r\n\r\nlet b = { \r\n  foo: 'hello' /* comment */\r\n};\r\n```\r\n**After --fix both comments are removed**\r\n```js\r\nlet a = {foo: 'hello'};\r\n\r\nlet b = {foo: 'hello'};\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/295586632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"freshp86","id":7547039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDcwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7547039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86","html_url":"https://github.com/freshp86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/295605378","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/8484#issuecomment-295605378","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/8484","id":295605378,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5NTYwNTM3OA==","user":{"login":"freshp86","id":7547039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDcwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7547039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86","html_url":"https://github.com/freshp86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-04-20T07:11:31Z","updated_at":"2017-04-20T07:13:35Z","body":"FYI, I have a condidate fix at https://github.com/freshp86/eslint/commit/496568626008a44652d5e41aebc9295d64f92f97. Tested\r\n\r\n```js\r\nlet a = {\r\n  /* comment */ foo: 'hello'\r\n};\r\n\r\nlet b = {\r\n  foo: 'hello' /* comment */\r\n};\r\n\r\nlet c = { /* comment */\r\n  foo: 'hello'\r\n};\r\n\r\nlet d = {\r\n  /* comment */\r\n}\r\n```\r\nand it becomes\r\n\r\n```js\r\nlet a = {/* comment */ foo: 'hello'};\r\n\r\nlet b = {foo: 'hello' /* comment */};\r\n\r\nlet c = { /* comment */\r\n  foo: 'hello'\r\n};\r\n\r\nlet d = {/*comment*/};\r\n```\r\nwhich seems correct. If that seems promising I can look on how to add proper tests and send a PR (have not contributed to ESLint before).\r\n\r\nHaving said that, when I use my complete config object (not posted in this bug), I end up with the comments removed again. I'll keep investigating that separately, since that seems to be caused by some other rule.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/295605378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"freshp86","id":7547039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDcwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7547039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86","html_url":"https://github.com/freshp86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"freshp86","id":7547039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDcwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7547039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86","html_url":"https://github.com/freshp86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freshp86/gists{/gist_id}","s